.TH NECKBEARD 1 "March 2026" "NeckBeard" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
neckbeard \- scripts for the minimalist over-engineer

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neckbeard
.I subcommand
.RI [ options ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B neckbeard
is a collection of bash scripts designed to eliminate repetitive terminal
tasks. It dispatches to scripts in the
.I scripts/
directory of the installation.

Run any subcommand with
.B \-h
or
.B \-\-help
for subcommand-specific usage.

.SH SUBCOMMANDS

.TP
.B tmuxinator \fR[\fB\-h\fR] [\fB\-r\fR]
Interactively select a Tmuxinator project config and a subdirectory using
.BR fzf ,
then launch the session. On first run you will be prompted for your dev
directory, which is saved to
.IR settings.env .

.RS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-reset
Delete saved settings and re-run first-time setup.
.RE

.TP
.B img\-optimize \fR[\fB\-h\fR] [\fIpath\fR]
Batch-convert JPEG and PNG images in a directory to WebP at three sizes:
hero (1920px, <500KB), blog (1200px, <200KB), and thumb (400px, <50KB).
Output is written to
.I web_optimized/{heros,blogs,thumbs}/
inside the target directory.

.RS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.RE

.TP
.B nb\-worktrees \fR[\fB\-h\fR]
Git worktree management. Work in progress.

.RS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.RE

.TP
.B update \fR[\fB\-h\fR]
Pull the latest changes from the upstream GitHub repository, fix permissions
on all scripts, and reset the update-check cache so the next run re-checks.

.RS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.RE

.SH UPDATE NOTIFICATIONS
Every invocation of
.B neckbeard
checks at most once every 24 hours whether the local branch is behind
upstream. If an update is available the following notice is printed before
the subcommand runs:

.RS
.nf
\[u1F4A1] Update available! Run: neckbeard update to get the latest.
.fi
.RE

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.neckBeard/settings.env
Stores the dev directory path used by the
.B tmuxinator
subcommand.

.TP
.I ~/.neckBeard/.last_update_check
Unix timestamp of the last upstream fetch. Delete this file to force an
immediate update check on the next run.

.TP
.I ~/.neckBeard/scripts/lib/colors.sh
Shared color palette sourced by every script.

.TP
.I ~/.neckBeard/scripts/lib/check-deps.sh
Provides
.BR check_deps ()
\(em checks for missing binaries and offers to install via
.BR pacman .

.TP
.I ~/.neckBeard/scripts/lib/check-update.sh
Provides
.BR check_for_update ()
\(em rate-limited upstream diff check.

.SH DEPENDENCIES
.BR fzf ,
.BR fd ,
.BR tmuxinator ,
.BR imagemagick " (magick),"
.BR git

